  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may unleash a wave of energy from your hellcore to hit multiple enemies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Hellcore Blast feat</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may spend two daily uses of your hellcore blast power to unleash a 30 ft. cone of energy. This cone deals 1d6 per hit die of damage, split evenly between the energy types of each of your energy resistances. The Reflex save to half this damage has a DC of 10+1/2 your character level + your Constitution modifier. This ability is a supernatural ability.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/xodai#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
